<BaseLayout title="Concrete Preparation and Repair Edmonton | Final Finish" description="Diamond grinding, repair, levelling, preparation and anti-slip coating options for Edmonton concrete floors." canonicalPath="/services/concrete-solutions"><SiteHeader /><main id="main-content"><InteriorHero eyebrow="Inspect · Prepare · Finish" title="A finished floor can only be as considered as the concrete beneath it." lead="Concrete repair, surface levelling and diamond grinding prepare the slab for the finish it is meant to carry." /><SectionShell><div class="card-grid"><article class="editorial-card"><h2>Diamond grinding</h2><p>Mechanical preparation removes surface contamination and creates a clean profile for the planned coating.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><h2>Repair and levelling</h2><p>Cracks, damage and uneven areas are assessed before the decorative finish is applied.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><h2>Anti-slip options</h2><p>Traction requirements are discussed against how the room is used and maintained.</p></article></div></SectionShell></main><SiteFooter /></BaseLayout>
